{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35740","headline":"谢僧寄茶 · 李咸用","name":"谢僧寄茶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"空门少年初志坚，摘芳爲药除睡眠。\n匡山茗树朝阳偏，暖萌如爪拏飞鸢。\n枝枝膏露凝滴圆，参差失向兜罗锦。\n倾筐短甑蒸新鲜，白紵眼细匀於研。\n甎排古砌春苔乾，殷勤寄我清明前。\n金槽无声飞碧烟，赤兽呵冰急铁喧。\n林风夕和真珠泉，半匙清粉搅潺湲。\n绿云轻绾湘娥鬟，尝来纵使重支枕，胡蝶寂寥空掩关。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35740.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35740","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}